================================================================================
Model weights
================================================================================

QuantEM ViT-B encoder + mitochondria / ER / nucleus / lipid-droplet heads
    Trained by the Arrojo e Drigo Lab on the QuantEM EM corpus, from scratch,
    using a DINOv3-style self-supervised recipe. Not initialised from Meta
    weights. Licence and training-data attribution are recorded on the Hugging
    Face model repository.
    Every released pack carries an exported TorchScript encoder, so the shipped
    artifact does not redistribute Meta's implementation. See the "Self-contained
    encoders" section of README.md.

OmniEM (EM-DINO) ViT-L encoder + heads
    Upstream encoder: EM-DINO, from "Unifying the Electron Microscopy Multiverse
    through a Large-scale Foundation Model" (bioRxiv 10.1101/2025.04.13.648639).
    The QuantEM heads are the Arrojo e Drigo Lab's; the base encoder is not.
    Architecture is constructed through `timm` (Apache-2.0) as
    `vit_large_patch14_dinov2.lvd142m`; the EM-DINO state dict is loaded into it.
    The released QuantEM packs (both families) are published under CC BY 4.0,
    stated on the Hugging Face repository they are fetched from.

